<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SPRK Coders Club Curriculum</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: white;
        }
        .glow-text-yellow {
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px #FFD166, 0 0 10px #FFD166;
        }
        .glow-text-blue {
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px #118AB2, 0 0 10px #118AB2;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-gray-800">

    <div class="container mx-auto p-4 md:p-8 max-w-5xl">

        <header class="text-center my-4">
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black glow-text-yellow tracking-wider">🚀 SPRK Coders Club</h1>
            <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 mt-1">Student Programmers Rising as AI Koders</p>
        </header>

        <main class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">

            <section class="bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-lg shadow-xl p-3 md:p-6">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#FF6B6B] mb-2 text-center">Your Journey into Code and AI -- Ready to get hands-on and build with tech?</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 text-center">Our club isn't just about code—we're all about exploring and leveraging AI to create cool projects and learn 'VibeCoding' together.</p>
            </section>

            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-stretch md:items-start gap-4">
                <div class="hidden md:flex flex-col justify-center items-center rounded-lg bg-[#073B4C] text-[#FFD166] p-3 text-center">
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-widest" style="writing-mode: vertical-lr; text-orientation: mixed;">SAMPLE TOPICS</span>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:flex-grow">
                    <section class="bg-[#EAEFF4] rounded-lg shadow-xl p-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                            <span class="text-2xl mr-2">🤖</span>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Getting Started: First Steps with Python</h3>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-gray-700 ml-2 text-sm">
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">ASCII Art:</span> Your first "Hello World" with a design twist.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Interactive Greetings:</span> Learn to make programs that talk back to you.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Silly Words:</span> Experiment with strings to reverse names or create mashups.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Fix It, Don’t Break It:</span> Discover the art of debugging.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="bg-gray-200 p-2 rounded-lg mt-2 text-sm text-gray-800 font-black">
                            ✨ Integrated Project: “My Digital Trading Card” ✨
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="bg-[#EAEFF4] rounded-lg shadow-xl p-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                            <span class="text-2xl mr-2">💡</span>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#5B6082]">Leveling Up: Programming Foundations</h3>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-gray-700 ml-2 text-sm">
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Storytelling Game:</span> Create your own "choose your own adventure" with if/else.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Multiplication Table:</span> Master for-loops to generate tables.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Guess The Number:</span> Build a simple game using while-loops.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Top Movie/Song List:</span> Learn to organize data with lists and dictionaries.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="bg-gray-200 p-2 rounded-lg mt-2 text-sm text-gray-800 font-black">
                            🕹️ Integrated Project: “Mini Arcade” 🕹️
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="bg-[#EAEFF4] rounded-lg shadow-xl p-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                            <span class="text-2xl mr-2">🧠</span>
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Building with AI: Applied Projects</h3>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-gray-700 ml-2 text-sm">
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Your Chatbot:</span> Build your own simple conversation bot.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Story Creator:</span> Make a keyword-driven story generator.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">Graph Your Grades:</span> Visualize your data with code.</li>
                            <li><span class="font-bold text-[#329D9C]">AI Jam Session:</span> Use AI to guide your code, then make it your own.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="bg-gray-200 p-2 rounded-lg mt-2 text-sm text-gray-800 font-black">
                            🤖 Integrated Project: “AI Study Buddy” 🤖
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <section class="bg-[#A6BBCD] text-white rounded-lg shadow-2xl p-4 md:p-5 mt-2 text-center">
                <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-black mb-2">Introductory Session Details</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 font-bold mb-2 text-sm">
                    <p>🗓 Wednesday, Sep 17</p>
                    <p>⏰ 1:45 PM – 2:30 PM</p>
                    <p>📍 Mrs. Jeffery’s Room 8</p>
                </div>
                <p class="font-bold text-base md:text-lg text-[#FF6B6B]">This is your chance to become a Student Representative or a Founding Member!</p>
            </section>
            
            <section class="bg-[#FFD166] text-[#073B4C] rounded-lg shadow-2xl p-4 md:p-5 mt-2 text-center">
                <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold mb-2">About Your Coach</h2>
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0 md:mr-3 mb-2 md:mb-0">
                        <div class="bg-gray-800 w-20 h-20 rounded-full mx-auto md:mx-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-lg font-black">Mr. PI</div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs md:text-sm">
                        Bala (aka Mr. PI – named for his passion for math and leveraging the first two letters of his last name) has decades of experience programming, coding, problem-solving and recently knee deep into AI and VibeCoding. He has created over a handful of startups and inspires students to experiment, innovate, and think critically while making coding approachable, fun, and meaningful.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

        </main>

        <footer class="text-center my-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold glow-text-yellow mb-1">⚡ Be The Spark That Makes Bristow Rock!</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">#SPRKCoders #BeTheSpark #FutureCoders</p>
        </footer>

    </div>
</body>
</html>
